From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hjviewer <haejin.cho@yonsei.ac.kr>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:21:23 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 75/85] hjviewer: review fixes, words lane
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- a checked checkbox has no ring around its fill: the theme's state side resolves the checked
  states to a clear side (a state side is drawn on checked boxes too)
- the desktop tab strip shows the selected pill's name only when every pill and the name fit
  in the width the actions leave
- the wake texts and the card menu's question call the remote PC "그 PC" / "that PC" (U19)
- clearer wording: "다른 기기가 내 PC 목록에서 뺌", "You have no PCs here yet."
- comments: "내 PC에서 빼기", no gap under hjvNetworkBanner's doc comment

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
